n the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/michigan/delta-county"],["ARC or PLC in Delta County","/arc-plc/michigan/delta-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, September to October on the middle of the grids came in at 53% of normal. Grid 30774 had its driest year in 1976, at 70% of normal.</p>"}
